as follow:
cos(x1) =  cos(x)cos(3pi/4)+sin(x)sin(3pi/4)
=  1/sqrt(2) * (sin(x) - cos(x))
sin(x1) =  sin(x)cos(3pi/4)-cos(x)sin(3pi/4)
